    ],
    "summary": "Play a rundown item",
    "description": "The simplest call for buttons (Stream Deck / Companion) and newsroom systems: the item's template, zone and data come from the project loaded on the channel. An optional body overrides data for `take` and `update`.\n\n**Rights:** admin, designer, operator.",
